WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.236 --> 00:00:03.334
- You don't buy a De Lorean
unless you want attention.

00:00:03.334 --> 00:00:05.036
Like, you do want to be out
in a De Lorean if you're

00:00:05.036 --> 00:00:06.805
having a bad day because
everybody's honking at you

00:00:06.805 --> 00:00:08.037
and giving you thumbs up.

00:00:08.037 --> 00:00:10.316
It's almost like a happiness mobile.

00:00:10.316 --> 00:00:13.366
Even with like 20 other
De Loreans parked around,

00:00:13.366 --> 00:00:16.520
like, what is the story with this one?

00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:19.817
(upbeat music)

00:00:19.817 --> 00:00:22.128
(beeps)

00:00:22.128 --> 00:00:24.824
First time I saw a De Lorean
was in a science museum,

00:00:24.824 --> 00:00:28.838
I wanna say in 1983, and they
had a brand new De Lorean,

00:00:28.838 --> 00:00:31.379
the car of the future parked
in the lobby of the science

00:00:31.379 --> 00:00:33.821
museum, it became my dream
car and I always wanted

00:00:33.821 --> 00:00:35.944
to own one, but it always
seemed like wanting to own,

00:00:35.944 --> 00:00:39.523
you know, Magnum PI's Ferrari,
or the van from the A Team,

00:00:39.523 --> 00:00:42.722
like something impossible
that would never happen.

00:00:42.722 --> 00:00:45.569
I wrote this novel, Ready
Player One, the protagonist

00:00:45.569 --> 00:00:48.777
is kind of obsessed with ‘80s
pop culture, and he loves

00:00:48.777 --> 00:00:51.302
Doc Brown's time machine,
but, he decides to take

00:00:51.302 --> 00:00:53.688
Doc Brown's time machine
and then mash in three more

00:00:53.688 --> 00:00:56.105
of his favorite 80s super
vehicles, the Ghostbuster's

00:00:56.105 --> 00:00:59.134
ectomobile, Ecto 1, KITT
from Knight Rider and then

00:00:59.134 --> 00:01:01.301
Buckaroo Bansai's jet car.

00:01:02.227 --> 00:01:04.982
So it has both a flux capacitor
for traveling through time

00:01:04.982 --> 00:01:07.614
and an oscillation over
thruster for traveling

00:01:07.614 --> 00:01:09.364
through solid matter.

00:01:10.644 --> 00:01:11.545
(upbeat music)

00:01:11.545 --> 00:01:13.749
I never imagined that I
would finish the book or that

00:01:13.749 --> 00:01:15.990
I would be able to sell it or
that it would become a movie

00:01:15.990 --> 00:01:18.509
but all those things happened,
and once I sold the movie

00:01:18.509 --> 00:01:21.773
rights then I realized I
could actually buy a De Lorean

00:01:21.773 --> 00:01:24.269
finally and then recreate
the De Lorean from the book.

00:01:24.269 --> 00:01:26.070
It makes me a lot more
interesting at my book signings

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:28.471
when I pull up in a time
machine, it's like a traveling

00:01:28.471 --> 00:01:29.388
‘80s museum.

00:01:31.299 --> 00:01:34.424
This is my iPad that I use
to control my time circuits.

00:01:34.424 --> 00:01:37.272
This operates the flux
capacitor, but mostly it's just

00:01:37.272 --> 00:01:40.004
fun like at the stoplight,
I just pretend that I'm

00:01:40.004 --> 00:01:43.623
dropping oil like Spy Hunter,
and then I also have KITT.

00:01:43.623 --> 00:01:45.619
- [KITT] A little consideration
would be a beginning.

00:01:45.619 --> 00:01:46.888
- And my light bar.

00:01:46.888 --> 00:01:49.187
When I need to clear traffic,
because I need to get to,

00:01:49.187 --> 00:01:51.368
you know, the site of a
job and bust a class five

00:01:51.368 --> 00:01:53.906
full roaming vapor, I can't
be sitting in traffic.

00:01:53.906 --> 00:01:56.617
(upbeat music)

00:01:56.617 --> 00:01:58.504
I love people who love the
things they love so passionately

00:01:58.504 --> 00:02:01.608
that it's just not enough
for them to talk about it,

00:02:01.608 --> 00:02:04.307
it has to manifest itself
in their lives in some way.

00:02:04.307 --> 00:02:06.424
They have to build their own
time machine or they have

00:02:06.424 --> 00:02:08.923
to cosplay, you know, their favorite character.

00:02:08.923 --> 00:02:11.183
I'm that kind of person, and
so the car is a way for me

00:02:11.183 --> 00:02:12.190
to do that.

00:02:12.190 --> 00:02:14.857
(upbeat music)

